# Records docs/demo.gif:  cd examples/demo && npm install && vhs demo.tape
Output ../../docs/demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 17
Set Width 1400
Set Height 450
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Hide
Type "export PS1='$ ' && clear" Enter
Show
Type "# An agent calls a CRM MCP server through GuardBee" Enter
Sleep 600ms
Type "node run.mjs" Enter
Sleep 9s
